# Supabase project credentials are provided via the platform secret store
# (/run/base44/app.env, wired through docker-compose.base44.yml env_file),
# not committed here. Provide the following in the Base44 Secrets input:
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL             - https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
#   VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY - project anon/publishable key
#   VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID      - <project-ref>
